      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "user1 ne phele signup kiya - server1 se\nconnection bna.\n\nphir jab login kiya to server 1 pe hi request\ngyi, connection established\n\nbut agle din user ne phir signin kiya, but iss\nbaar server2 ko request gyi. Server2 k pass\nto details hai hi nhi user k abb wo user not\nfound bol dega.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "user1 ne phele signup kiya - server1 se connection bna.\n\nphir jab login kiya to server 1 pe hi request gyi, connection established\n\nbut agle din user ne phir signin kiya, but iss\nbaar server2 ko request gyi. Server2 k pass to details hai hi nhi user k abb wo user not found bol dega.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
